	\n				\n				\n				\n				TICKETING INFO\nSeason tickets are now available. 
	6-show packages start at just $34 per-show. \nTickets will start at $46 an
	d will be available beginning July 13 online or by calling TUTS Guest Serv
	ices at 713-558-8887. Tickets will also available in person Monday through
	 Friday from Noon to 6 p.m. at the TUTS Box Office\, located in the Hobby 
	Center lobby. \nDiscounted group tickets are available for parties of 10 o
	r more.Theatre Under The Stars has a variety of accessibility options for 
	guests.Learn more about accessible performances and other services here. \
